you guys ready  good evening i'm captain dory corn with  the las vegas metropolitan police  department  i currently oversee our homicide sex  crimes and abuse neglect sections and  tonight i'm here to brief you on a  homicide that involved multiple victims  at 8 30 pm this evening  we received a 911 call regarding a  shooting  that happened inside of a hotel room  near the 3400 block of las vegas  boulevard  the initial details indicated that three  people had been shot and that one of  them was deceased  our officers immediately responded  they actually arrived on scene with  approximately within about a minute of  the initial call  and then what they discovered was that  three people had been shot one of them  was deceased our officers immediately  began providing medical attention so did  security personnel  the two other persons had been shot were  immediately transported to umc hospital  and then we immediately began securing  the scene as we normally do on a  shooting like this  it's still early into the investigation  we're still determining exactly what  happened but we can tell you at least  preliminarily  that we there was an altercation that  happened in the room between four  individuals we believe all known to each  other  we believe it was an isolated incident  that happened inside of the room  and that during that altercation one  individual ended up shooting three other  individuals  the other two individuals that were  transported are adult females  they are in critical condition or shot  multiple times  and then the other  deceased unfortunately he's a male  victim  right now we are asking the public as we  normally do on any types of incident  like this if you have any information  related to this incident please call  crime stoppers  and provide any information you can  and i'll just kind of add just one note  which is  these types of incidents any types of  extreme violence that happens in our  city we take very seriously you've seen  it with all the investigations we  conduct  we're fortunate to have the best  homicide investigative unit in the  country with the highest clearance rates  for a reason so we're confident we will  solve this case  the suspect is currently outstanding  uh we believe he is a black male adult a  little heavier set  but we do have good information good  leads that we're working and as i said  we have a lot of confidence that we will  catch  the killer in this case and we will uh  close this investigation as we always do  other than that it's uh there's no other  disruption to the las vegas strip or any  other area right now we've limited any  kind of traffic closures initially the  response required some you know  extra police presence because we were  still trying to figure out exactly what  occurred but at this time there should  be really nothing visible or disruptive  to the general public and no further  threat at this time that we believe uh  is you know opposed to the general  public with that i have time for a few  questions then we've got to get back to  the investigation  so adult male approximately i believe  40s or 50s  were these people visiting town or do  they happen to live here  we don't know if they currently live  here but there is a local nexus we're  not we're not certain exactly if they've  revisited or  but there is a local address is  associated to at least one of the  individuals  on the eighth floor  so as of now we we've secured off a  variety of areas because we're still  trying to determine exactly where the  entire crime scene is but uh we're  confident to say it was isolated inside  of a room  in one of the properties there  have you guys talked to the surveillance  department is there surveillance cameras  within that hallway  you know what at this time we're still  exploring all investigative leads that  includes picking up all of the  surveillance data that we potentially  could get but i will point out that  we've  the security personnel and our  partnerships in general all across the  strip have been remarkable uh not just  in in this case uh but all the all the  incidents that we've had on las vegas  strip we have a great partnership with  all of our hotel partners in this  particular case uh security was hand in  hand working with us from the very  beginning making this a very effective  investigation and a lot of credit goes  to them and our officers for the  immediate response time to be here  within a minute of a shooting happening  and to be able to provide medical  attention could make a difference  potentially for the other victims when  you say a minute is that just to the  front doors or to the actual room itself  i'm not sure exactly but i can tell you  that uh within a minute of the call  coming in a 9-1-1 call we had officers  already announcing that they're arriving  on scene uh that may be the initial  property or maybe in the elevators not  really sure i just have maybe one or two  more questions  you know what i think that the public  here has a lot of confidence in their  police department and so when they saw  our officers arriving pretty quickly and  handling business i think that reassured  everyone and kept things calm and helped  same thing for the security personnel i  think they were able to maintain calm  and uh we didn't see any major  disruptions fortunately  i'm sorry  my name oh sure my name is dory corrin  d-o-r-i  k-o-r-e-n  the captain over our homicide sex crimes  bureau thank you folks i appreciate it  unfortunately we have to get right back  to the investigation but thank you guys  have a good night

